<main class="section">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">How we started</span>
      <h2>A shop built around the books we couldn't stop recommending</h2>
      <p>Marginalia opened as a single shelf in the back of a stationery shop, stocked with whatever the three of us had just finished and pressed into a friend's hands. It grew because people kept asking where to find the next one.</p>
      <p>We still work that way. Every title on the site has been read cover to cover by someone on the team, and the shelf stays small on purpose — sixteen books at a time, replaced slowly, never chasing a chart.</p>
      <p>We're not trying to be the biggest bookshop online. We'd rather be the one you trust to hand you something good.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img id="about-cover" alt="A stack of featured book covers" style="border-radius:3px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lift);">
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

