  <div class="container value-grid">
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we stock</span>
      <h3>Eight shelves, kept narrow</h3>
      <p>Fiction, sci-fi, fantasy, mystery, poetry, biography, classics and non-fiction — two titles deep on each, so nothing gets lost in the crowd.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="eyebrow">How we choose</span>
      <h3>No bestseller lists</h3>
      <p>We pick by hand, based on what kept us up reading — not on what a chart says everyone else is buying.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
      <span class="eyebrow">Where we are</span>
      <h3>One small shop, real people</h3>
      <p>Based in Warrington, packed by hand, and always happy to talk books if you drop us a line.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

